  "Q11": {
    "q11_valid_1": {
      "verdict": "yes",
      "rationale": "Item-by-item count (submission order): (1) memorandum recital 'zero section 301 tariff rate' (47719) vs proposal 'reduced Section 301 tariff rate' (34274) and notice (47318) - COUNTED (key #1). (2) Cambodia/Guatemala etc. presented as economies tariffed at 10% 'as a result', with only five actually moving from 12.5% - NOT COUNTED: the memorandum/notice do not say these economies moved (Cambodia and Guatemala were already at 10% in the proposal), and the key lists this observation on the do-not-count list. (3) notice 47330 'all of the products proposed for exemption in Annex A ... except the non-pharmaceutical applications of certain chemical products' vs the proposal's 'all articles and parts currently subject to section 232 tariffs' (34274) and note 52(f)'s closed heading list (47362-63) - COUNTED (key #8, as one item). (4) notice 'cannot be grown or produced in sufficient quantities or at reasonable prices' (47319, 47321 - verified by fr_grep) vs memorandum Sec. 1(b)(iii) without 'reasonable prices' - COUNTED (key #2). (5) 11056(1) amending only the 'chapeau of Annex II' while clauses (1)/(3) still print August 19 (46641, 46655, 46665) - COUNTED (key #9; 2026-17294 text verified). (6) 11062(3) citing a September 8 dairy scope proclamation that does not exist (only 11064 and 11065 published) - COUNTED (key #4). (7) later recitals saying the duties were 'effective August 19, 2026' (58311, 58331, 68861) - NOT COUNTED: the key's do-not-count list (an accurate account of the date 11046 set, later delayed by 11056). Exact total: 5 valid discrepancies."
    },
    "q11_valid_2": {
      "verdict": "yes",
      "rationale": "Total 5 valid discrepancies (see the item-by-item list under q11_valid_1)."
    },
    "q11_valid_3": {
      "verdict": "yes",
      "rationale": "Total 5 valid discrepancies."
    },
    "q11_valid_4": {
      "verdict": "yes",
      "rationale": "Total 5 valid discrepancies."
    },
    "q11_valid_5": {
      "verdict": "yes",
      "rationale": "Total 5 valid discrepancies."
    },
    "q11_valid_6": {
      "verdict": "no",
